{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人渐渐喜欢上另一个人，享受彼此亲近，却始终害怕自己的在乎会成为负担，也害怕有一天对方不再需要自己。他在坦白、退缩和患得患失之间反复摇摆，最后决定不再要求永远的保证，珍惜眼前的亲近，也不再隐藏自己的喜欢。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却不敢多说\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近甜蜜又怕结束\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"只想沉浸当下\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕失去自在\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"被看穿后反而慌张\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"对方未变仍觉孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"想成为对方的依靠\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"主动亲近仍怕无常\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕对方不再需要他\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"不猜以后，享受此刻\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"愿意陪伴但不由自己\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再克制地表达喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"渴求保证又想收回\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"接受未知，不再隐藏\",\n      \"echo\": \"S13\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是S06到S09，以及S11到S13：他一会儿因为对方没有退开而安心，一会儿又担心未来会失去这份亲近，类似的不安反复出现，情绪转折比较细。最抓人的是S05到S06，心意终于被看见后，他没有如释重负，反而更加害怕，但对方一如既往的态度又给了他安慰；S14最后选择接受未知、不再隐藏喜欢，也让整个故事有了落点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3c03bcbe-acf4-42a3-9707-684b51619b50", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190526149425Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:06:00.247009+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2023e256ac7d8bc5278a450f741eae4e5c773c2f10279f5053c64f1f3c0e6ea7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190526149425Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "631140d9836086ba87ca823960ba62158ab00b5a1714ce7ff60dfef428f102c7"}}}
